WEBVTT

00:07.965 --> 00:09.206
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.275 --> 00:11.034
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:11.103 --> 00:12.413
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.482 --> 00:14.551
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.620 --> 00:17.551
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.620 --> 00:19.586
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.655 --> 00:21.655
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.724 --> 00:23.241
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.310 --> 00:25.517
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.586 --> 00:27.448
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.517 --> 00:29.517
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.586 --> 00:31.655
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.724 --> 00:33.586
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.655 --> 00:35.689
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.758 --> 00:37.448
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.517 --> 00:39.586
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.655 --> 00:41.068
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:41.137 --> 00:42.862
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.931 --> 00:45.241
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.310 --> 00:47.827
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.896 --> 00:50.689
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:52.603 --> 00:55.086
[wacky upbeat music]
[古怪欢快的音乐]

00:55.155 --> 01:02.362
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:05.706 --> 01:08.155
- [gulping nosily]
- [大声吞咽]

01:08.224 --> 01:10.051
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

01:10.120 --> 01:13.844
- [slurping and popping]
- [发出声音和爆裂声]

01:13.913 --> 01:15.948
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

01:16.017 --> 01:18.844
[plate squeaking]
- [moaning]
[盘子吱吱作响]
- [呻吟]

01:18.913 --> 01:21.637
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

01:21.706 --> 01:24.258
- [belching]
- [打嗝]

01:24.327 --> 01:26.258
- [growling fiercely]
- [激烈咆哮]

01:26.327 --> 01:28.120
[steam whistle blows]
[蒸汽哨声响起]

01:28.189 --> 01:29.844
[screams]
[尖叫声]

01:29.913 --> 01:34.844
Another rotten day
at the Krusty Krab!
又是烂日
在蟹堡王！

01:34.913 --> 01:36.775
[silence]
[沉默]

01:36.844 --> 01:38.844
[all chomping nosily]
[大家都吵闹地咀嚼着]

01:38.913 --> 01:41.327
Not that anyone's listening.
并不是有人在听。

01:42.637 --> 01:44.155
Huh?
啊？

01:44.224 --> 01:48.017
- I'm listening, Squidward.
Tell SpongeBob your troubles.
- 我在听，章鱼哥。
告诉海绵宝宝你的烦恼。

01:48.086 --> 01:50.051
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

01:50.120 --> 01:51.362
[microphone squeals]
[麦克风尖叫声]

01:51.431 --> 01:53.844
- [sighs]
If you must know,
- [叹气]
如果你一定要知道的话，

01:53.913 --> 01:57.672
I'm stuck in a dead-end job
working at this grease trap.
我陷入了一个没有出路的工作
在这个隔油池工作。

02:01.775 --> 02:04.396
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

02:04.465 --> 02:06.603
- My tentacles hurt.
- 我的触手受伤了。

02:09.155 --> 02:13.327
And I live next door
to the number one
而我就住在隔壁
到第一名

02:13.396 --> 02:16.534
most annoying neighbor
in Bikini Bottom.
最烦人的邻居
在比基尼底部。

02:16.603 --> 02:18.189
[grumbles]
[抱怨]

02:19.362 --> 02:21.844
- Whoo!
Number one!
- 呼！
第一！

02:21.913 --> 02:25.086
- One more annoying thing,
and I'm gonna lose it.
- 还有一件烦人的事，
我会失去它。

02:25.155 --> 02:27.051
- [whimpers]
- [呜咽]

02:27.120 --> 02:29.155
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

02:29.224 --> 02:32.224
- [sighs]
And there it is.
- [叹气]
就是这样。

02:32.293 --> 02:34.637
- Your Krabby Patty meal, sir.
- 您的蟹肉饼餐，先生。

02:36.982 --> 02:38.051
- Huh?
- 啊？

02:38.120 --> 02:39.879
Ew!
呃！

02:39.948 --> 02:41.948
Fingernails.
指甲。

02:42.017 --> 02:44.982
[overlapping chatter]
[重叠的喋喋不休]

02:45.051 --> 02:46.879
- That's worse than a hair!
- 这比头发还糟糕！

02:46.948 --> 02:48.741
- [gulping]
- [吞咽]

02:56.051 --> 02:57.913
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

02:57.982 --> 02:59.465
- Ew.
- 呃。

03:04.431 --> 03:07.879
- SpongeBob, would you
stop biting your nails?
- 海绵宝宝，你愿意吗
别再咬指甲了吗？

03:07.948 --> 03:11.051
- Oh, Squidward,
I never bite my nails.
-哦，章鱼哥，
我从来不咬指甲。

03:11.120 --> 03:13.017
- What do you call that?
- 你管它叫什么？

03:13.086 --> 03:14.775
- [yelps]
Oh.
- [尖叫声]
哦。

03:14.844 --> 03:17.948
- Ugh, nail-biting
is a disgusting bad habit,
- 呃，咬指甲
是一种令人厌恶的坏习惯

03:18.017 --> 03:19.534
so quit it!
所以戒掉吧！

03:19.603 --> 03:22.534
- I promise not to bite
my nails ever again.
- 我保证不咬人
我的指甲再次出现。

03:26.706 --> 03:28.844
- Ahem!
- 咳咳！

03:30.500 --> 03:32.017
- [laughs]
Oops.
- [笑]
哎呀。

03:32.086 --> 03:35.362
I guess biting my
nails has become a bad habit.
我猜想咬我的
剪指甲已经成为一种坏习惯。

03:39.051 --> 03:42.672
Oh, breaking this
nail-biting habit'll be a snap.
哦，打破这个
咬指甲的习惯很快就会养成。

03:44.948 --> 03:47.706
[chewing nosily]
[大声咀嚼]

03:50.465 --> 03:52.879
Just have to keep
my nails away...
只需要保留
我的指甲离开...

03:54.465 --> 03:56.293
From my mouth.
从我嘴里说出来。

03:59.775 --> 04:01.637
Simple.
简单的。

04:03.327 --> 04:04.879
Huh? Ugh...
啊？啊...

04:04.948 --> 04:07.465
[chewing nosily]
[大声咀嚼]

04:07.534 --> 04:09.534
I need a plan B.
我需要一个B计划。

04:10.568 --> 04:13.465
[light whimsical music]
[轻快的异想天开的音乐]

04:13.534 --> 04:15.844
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:15.913 --> 04:18.810
There, now my nails
are too pretty to bite.
那里，现在我的指甲
太漂亮了，舍不得咬。

04:21.155 --> 04:22.568
Huh?
啊？

04:24.982 --> 04:26.120
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

04:26.189 --> 04:27.810
- [meows]
- [喵]

04:28.948 --> 04:31.775
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

04:31.844 --> 04:33.189
Oh.
哦。

04:33.258 --> 04:34.568
- [meows]
- What's that?
- [喵]
- 那是什么？

04:34.637 --> 04:36.706
Oh, what
a great idea, Gary.
哦，什么
好主意，加里。

04:36.775 --> 04:39.293
A walk would
really clear my head.
散步会
我的头脑真的很清醒。

04:39.362 --> 04:41.327
[light playful music]
[轻快俏皮的音乐]

04:41.396 --> 04:44.879
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

04:44.948 --> 04:47.293
- [meows]
- [喵]

04:48.913 --> 04:51.224
- [sniffs]
- [嗅嗅]

04:51.293 --> 04:54.500
Ah, I just needed
a breath of fresh water.
啊，我只是需要
呼吸新鲜的水。

04:54.568 --> 04:57.120
[sniffs]
Ah.
[嗅嗅]
啊。

04:57.189 --> 05:00.396
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

05:00.465 --> 05:02.568
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

05:03.982 --> 05:05.258
That'll take care of it.
这样就可以搞定了。

05:05.327 --> 05:07.120
[groans]
[呻吟]

05:07.189 --> 05:09.534
Oh, don't do it.
哦，别这样做。

05:09.603 --> 05:12.948
Don't do it.
Don't do it.
不要这样做。
不要这样做。

05:19.327 --> 05:21.879
Well...I do'd it.
嗯……我做到了。

05:21.948 --> 05:23.500
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

05:24.775 --> 05:26.982
Time for stronger measures.
是时候采取更强有力的措施了。

05:28.706 --> 05:30.775
All right, self, let's see
ya get out of that one.
好吧，自己，让我们看看
你离开那个吧。

05:30.844 --> 05:33.741
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:35.706 --> 05:38.500
- Whoa, SpongeBob,
are you okay?
- 哇哦，海绵宝宝，
你还好吗？

05:38.568 --> 05:40.568
- [gasp]
Fred, your nails.
- [喘气]
弗雷德，你的指甲。

05:40.637 --> 05:42.913
They're so...beautiful.
她们是如此……美丽。

05:42.982 --> 05:46.224
- Aw, thanks.
I really pride myself on--
- 哦，谢谢。
我真的很自豪——

05:46.293 --> 05:48.224
- [chomping]
- [咀嚼]

05:48.293 --> 05:49.637
- My nails!
- 我的指甲！

05:49.706 --> 05:53.224
- [laughing]
Must bite nails.
- [笑]
一定要咬指甲。

05:53.293 --> 05:56.396
[laughs menacingly]
[威胁性地笑]

05:58.672 --> 06:01.465
- [humming]
Give me the works, Ethel.
- [嗡嗡声]
把作品给我，埃塞尔。

06:01.534 --> 06:05.500
Ugh, my nails
are in terrible shape.
呃，我的指甲
状况很糟糕。

06:06.500 --> 06:09.431
[moans]
[呻吟声]

06:09.500 --> 06:12.913
Ooh, that feels good.
哦，感觉不错。

06:12.982 --> 06:14.982
- [chomping]
- [stammering] Ethel,
- [咀嚼]
- [结结巴巴]埃塞尔，

06:15.051 --> 06:16.810
you know I like to keep
my nails long--
你知道我喜欢保留
我的指甲很长——

06:16.879 --> 06:18.810
[shouting]
[喊叫]

06:18.879 --> 06:20.672
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

06:25.431 --> 06:28.500
- So when should we schedule
your next appointment?
- 那么我们应该什么时候安排
你的下一次约会？

06:28.568 --> 06:30.500
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

06:30.568 --> 06:32.431
- Whoa!
- 哇！

06:32.500 --> 06:34.224
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

06:34.293 --> 06:36.913
- [groans]
- SpongeBob!
- [呻吟]
- 海绵宝宝！

06:36.982 --> 06:39.948
Trying out a new
look with your face?
尝试新的
用脸看？

06:40.017 --> 06:43.224
- [chomping]
- I like it!
- [咀嚼]
- 我喜欢它！

06:43.293 --> 06:46.051
- Oh, Patrick, I can't stop...
- 哦，帕特里克，我无法停止......

06:46.120 --> 06:47.948
biting my fingernails.
咬我的指甲。

06:48.017 --> 06:50.258
- Hmm.
Mm-hmm.
- 唔。
嗯嗯。

06:50.327 --> 06:53.465
Ha! I know just what you need!
哈!我知道你需要什么！

06:53.534 --> 06:55.051
[laughs]
[笑]

06:55.120 --> 06:56.810
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

06:59.603 --> 07:01.775
[people screaming]
[人们尖叫]

07:01.844 --> 07:04.568
Glove World makes me
forget all my troubles...
手套世界让我
忘记我所有的烦恼...

07:04.637 --> 07:06.568
and my name.
和我的名字。

07:06.637 --> 07:08.051
- You're right.
- 你说得对。

07:08.120 --> 07:10.155
I've forgotten all
about biting my...
我已经全部忘记了
关于咬我的...

07:10.224 --> 07:11.948
nails!
指甲！

07:12.017 --> 07:15.017
[howling]
[嚎叫]

07:21.913 --> 07:24.189
[shouts]
[喊叫]

07:24.258 --> 07:25.327
- Huh.
- 嗯。

07:25.396 --> 07:28.741
- Hey you, gimme that.
- 嘿你，给我那个。

07:28.810 --> 07:30.603
Knuckle 22 to base.
指节 22 至底座。

07:30.672 --> 07:34.120
We've got a nail-biter
in Pinky Land.
我们有一个咬指甲的人
在粉红之地。

07:35.603 --> 07:37.637
[both shouting]
[两人大喊]

07:43.948 --> 07:47.189
- [chomping]
I think--I think...
- [咀嚼]
我想——我想……

07:47.258 --> 07:50.086
I need help.
[chomping]
我需要帮助。
[咀嚼]

07:50.155 --> 07:51.500
- [line trills]
Cheeks residence.
- [台词颤音]
脸颊住所。

07:51.568 --> 07:53.362
- Sandy!
- 桑迪！

07:53.431 --> 07:54.879
[chomping]
[bell dings]
[咀嚼]
[铃声]

07:54.948 --> 07:55.913
- Hmm.
- 唔。

07:55.982 --> 07:57.120
- [chomping]
[bell dings]
- [咀嚼]
[铃声]

07:57.189 --> 07:58.982
- Aww.
- 哇。

07:59.051 --> 08:00.706
- [chomping]
[bell dings]
- [咀嚼]
[铃声]

08:00.775 --> 08:02.879
- Don't worry, SpongeBob.
- 别担心，海绵宝宝。

08:02.948 --> 08:05.224
We'll stop your nail-biting
habit quicker than
我们会阻止你咬指甲
习惯比

08:05.293 --> 08:06.913
a jet-powered jackrabbit!
喷气动力长耳大野兔！

08:06.982 --> 08:09.189
This'll keep your fingers
out of your kisser.
这会让你的手指
从你的吻中出来。

08:09.258 --> 08:11.293
- I sure hope so.
- 我当然希望如此。

08:11.362 --> 08:13.603
- Ah.
- Mmm.
- 啊。
- 嗯。

08:14.637 --> 08:17.741
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

08:21.293 --> 08:23.672
- Oh...uh-uh.
- 哦...呃-呃。

08:23.741 --> 08:26.224
Tell me he ain't doing
what I think he's doing.
告诉我他没有做
我认为他在做什么。

08:26.293 --> 08:29.431
- Oh, he's good.
- 哦，他很好。

08:29.500 --> 08:31.706
- [chomping]
- [咀嚼]

08:31.775 --> 08:34.741
- SpongeBob,
that's just plain wrong.
- 海绵宝宝，
这完全是错误的。

08:38.637 --> 08:40.603
I guess we're gonna
have to watch you
我想我们会
必须看着你

08:40.672 --> 08:43.017
like Mr. Krabs
watches his bank account!
像蟹老板一样
监视他的银行账户！

08:43.086 --> 08:45.293
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

08:45.362 --> 08:46.637
- Huh?
- 啊？

08:46.706 --> 08:48.603
- [grumbles]
- [抱怨]

08:51.224 --> 08:52.603
Oh!
哦！

08:52.672 --> 08:54.327
[both snoring]
[两人都打呼噜]

09:03.672 --> 09:06.155
What, what?
Where'd he go?
什么，什么？
他去哪儿了？

09:06.224 --> 09:08.810
[unintelligible shouting]
[难以理解的喊叫]

09:08.879 --> 09:11.051
- [chomping]
Hi, Sandy.
- [咀嚼]
嗨，桑迪。

09:11.120 --> 09:13.913
- It's high time we got
you some professional help.
- 我们是时候了
你一些专业的帮助。

09:16.534 --> 09:18.603
This doctor's
the best hypnotherapist
这位医生的
最好的催眠治疗师

09:18.672 --> 09:20.637
in Bikini Bottom.
在比基尼底部。

09:20.706 --> 09:22.879
He'll sort out
your bad habit.
他会解决的
你的坏习惯。

09:22.948 --> 09:26.189
- The doctor will see you now,
Mr. SquarePants.
- 医生现在就来看你，
方裤先生。

09:31.051 --> 09:33.706
- Oh, please relax,
Mr. SquarePants.
- 哦，请放松，
方裤先生。

09:35.017 --> 09:36.637
Now, what seems
to be the trouble?
现在看来，什么
成为麻烦？

09:36.706 --> 09:38.500
- Doctor, I can't stop...
- 医生，我无法停止...

09:38.568 --> 09:39.913
I can't stop...
我无法停止...

09:39.982 --> 09:41.293
I can't stop biting my nails!
我忍不住咬指甲！

09:41.362 --> 09:42.603
I don't know what to do.
我不知道该怎么办。

09:42.672 --> 09:44.189
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

09:44.258 --> 09:47.017
- Well, let us take a peek
into your subconscious
- 好吧，让我们看一下
进入你的潜意识

09:47.086 --> 09:49.155
and see what
is causing your problem.
看看什么
导致了你的问题。

09:49.224 --> 09:52.603
Keep your eyes on the watch,
Mr. SquarePants.
眼睛一直盯着手表，
方裤先生。

09:52.672 --> 09:55.327
Watch the watch,
Mr. SquarePants.
看手表，
方裤先生。

09:55.396 --> 09:57.844
- Watch the watch...
Watch the watch...
- 看手表...
看手表...

09:57.913 --> 10:02.155
[woozily]
Watch the watch.
[昏昏沉沉]
看手表。

10:02.948 --> 10:06.741
- What seems to be troubling
you, Mr. SquarePants?
- 似乎有什么令人烦恼的事情
你，方裤先生吗？

10:06.810 --> 10:10.120
- I can't stop...
biting my...
- 我无法停止...
咬我的...

10:10.189 --> 10:12.879
nails.
指甲。

10:12.948 --> 10:15.293
- Why do you want
to bite your nails?
- 你为什么想要
咬指甲？

10:15.362 --> 10:17.568
- Stuck in dead-end job.
- 陷入了没有出路的工作。

10:17.637 --> 10:20.017
Work in a grease trap.
在隔油池中工作。

10:20.086 --> 10:21.741
- Go on.
- 继续。

10:22.879 --> 10:24.741
- Tentacles hurt.
- 触手受伤了。

10:24.810 --> 10:27.293
- Tentacles?
Hmm, interesting.
- 触手？
嗯，有趣。

10:27.362 --> 10:29.706
- Neighbor...SpongeBob...
- 邻居...海绵宝宝...

10:29.775 --> 10:31.396
annoying.
恼人的。

10:31.465 --> 10:35.293
- But aren't you SpongeBob,
Mr. SquarePants?
- 但你不是海绵宝宝吗
方裤先生？

10:35.362 --> 10:38.293
- No...I am Squidward.
- 不...我是章鱼哥。

10:38.362 --> 10:40.672
- [gasp]
Mr. SquarePants!
- [喘气]
方裤先生！

10:40.741 --> 10:42.431
Obviously,
you have subconsciously
显然，
你潜意识里有

10:42.500 --> 10:46.258
internalized Mr. Squidward's
problems as your own.
内化了章鱼哥先生的
问题当成自己的问题。

10:46.327 --> 10:49.120
When I snap my fingers,
you'll realize
当我打响指的时候
你会意识到

10:49.189 --> 10:51.948
you are not Squidward.
You are SpongeBob,
你不是章鱼哥。
你是海绵宝宝，

10:52.017 --> 10:54.465
and your desire to bite
your nails will--
和你想咬的欲望
你的指甲会——

10:54.534 --> 10:56.396
Poof!
Disappear.
噗！
消失。

10:56.465 --> 10:59.017
[snaps fingers]
- [gasps]
[打响指]
- [喘气]

11:00.844 --> 11:02.500
Am I cured?
我痊愈了吗？

11:02.568 --> 11:04.534
- Yeah, you are cured.
- 是的，你已经痊愈了。

11:04.603 --> 11:07.189
- Whoopee!
Thanks, Doctor...
- 哎哟！
谢谢，医生...

11:07.258 --> 11:09.362
Doctor...
医生...

11:09.431 --> 11:12.017
Hans!
汉斯！

11:14.431 --> 11:15.741
[gasps]
[喘气]

11:15.810 --> 11:19.844
Giant, delicious
fingernails!
巨大，好吃
指甲！

11:19.913 --> 11:23.017
- [shouts]
Mr. SquarePants, please!
- [喊叫]
方裤先生，请！

11:23.086 --> 11:24.534
- Doctor Hans,
I'm here for my weekly
- 汉斯医生，
我来这里是为了我的每周

11:24.603 --> 11:27.500
appointment--
预约 -

11:27.568 --> 11:30.327
- [chomping]
- [咀嚼]

11:30.396 --> 11:34.362
- I'm going to need
therapy for my therapy...
- 我需要
治疗为我的治疗...

- 我需要
